    //   N  \u2014 VIEW space. Correct, and only correct, where it is dotted against V, which is
    //        also view space: the detector-footprint LOD (g) and the grazing-angle term (a).
    //   NW \u2014 WORLD space. Correct wherever the term means "up", "down" or "the compass bearing
    //        the afternoon sun came from": the relief gate and the solar aspect (d), the cavity
    //        term (e), and the sky-loss term below (which is outside USE_FORM and therefore
